{\"text\":\"It's a BRAND NEW DAY for Peter Parker. Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him -- and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him -- sparks a change in Peter he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\\n\\nThe world may have forgotten Peter Parker, but he hasn’t forgotten them.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It's a BRAND NEW DAY for Peter Parker. Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him sparks a change he may not have the power to control.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":140,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qwVAc2MmlwU\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000122\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000212\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003682\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007703\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010992\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018489\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018490\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000063\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000263\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000807\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000969\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002248\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000003\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"db62eee0-9bc4-4169-8b2c-be507018ab7e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008728\",\"hoCode\":\"