":\"The Rotunda\",\"line2\":\"Clarence Street\",\"city\":\"Kingston-upon-Thames\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00008728\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"It's a BRAND NEW DAY for Peter Parker. Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him -- and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him -- sparks a change in Peter he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\\n\\nThe world may have forgotten Peter Parker, but he hasn’t forgotten them.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It's a BRAND NEW DAY for Peter Parker. Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him sparks a change he may not have the power to control.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":140,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qwVAc2MmlwU\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000122\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000212\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003682\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007703\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010992\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018489\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018490\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000063\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000263\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000807\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000969\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002248\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000003\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"db62eee0-9bc4-4169-8b2c-be507018ab7e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008728\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009856\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008836\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Paw Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm, the PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs. They meet Rex, a pup who has been stranded on the island for years and has become an expert in all things dino-related. When the PAW Patrol's archrival, Mayor Humdinger, begins recklessly mining in hopes of exploiting the island for its natural resources, he inadvertently causes a huge, dormant volcano to erupt. The PAW Patrol pups are thrown into a series of high-stakes, dino-sized rescues bigger than anything they've done before, as they must stop Humdinger before everything on the island goes extinct.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm, the PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs. They meet Rex.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000011\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W6q8uzqfB5k\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002221\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002222\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003857\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004749\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009450\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009456\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009459\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\